OL,3,GNEWSAHeadteachers say families will
OL,4,Astruggle after another rise in school
OL,5,Adinner prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FA headteacher has said she believes
OL,8,F"families are going to struggle" as the
OL,9,Fprice of school dinners is to increase
OL,10,Ffor the second year in a row.
OL,12,FThe price of meals for pre-school,
OL,13,Fprimary and special school pupils will
OL,14,Fgo up by 30p, for post-primary pupils
OL,15,Fwill they will rise by 15%. It follows
OL,16,Fan increase of just under 20%
OL,17,Fintroduced by the Education Authority
OL,18,F(EA) in January 2026.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
