OL,3,GNEWSAHeadteachers say families will
OL,4,Astruggle after another rise in school
OL,5,Adinner prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FAine Leslie, principal of Malone
OL,8,FIntegrated College in Belfast, said
OL,9,Fthis will put further pressure on
OL,10,Ffamilies who are already worried about
OL,11,Fthe cost of living crisis.
OL,13,FBut the EA said that the amount parents
OL,14,Fwould have to pay was still well below
OL,15,Fthe average cost of producing a school
OL,16,Fmeal, estimated at over #5.20.
